{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — T01 FAQ & Guarantee Section
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-editorial-section" id="faq">
  <div class="zvhc-container" style="max-width: 860px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">HONEST ANSWERS</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>Everything you need to know about our sourcing, textures, application, and 30-day guarantee.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="zvhc-accordion-group">
      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" open>
        <summary>
          <span>What is Batana Oil and where does Zavelyn source it?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="zvhc-accordion-content">
          Batana oil is extracted from the nut of the American palm tree (Elaeis oleifera) indigenous to La Moskitia, Honduras. It has been used for centuries by indigenous communities as a sacred hair and scalp treatment. Zavelyn sources pure cold-pressed Batana without synthetic alteration or mineral oil dilution.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item">
        <summary>
          <span>Will this make my fine or wavy hair feel greasy?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="zvhc-accordion-content">
          Not when used as directed! For finer textures (Type 1-2), we recommend applying Batana Oil as a 20-30 minute pre-wash hot oil scalp treatment, then shampooing out. For medium to coarse or curly textures (Type 3-4), a few drops can be used as a daily leave-in moisture sealer on damp ends.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item">
        <summary>
          <span>How do the Keratin Fibers stay in place throughout the day?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="zvhc-accordion-content">
          Zavelyn Keratin Building Fibers are processed with an inherent electrostatic charge. When shaken gently over thinning areas, they naturally cling to your existing hair shafts like magnetic branches, resisting wind, light perspiration, and everyday movement until washed out with shampoo.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item">
        <summary>
          <span>What is the 30-Day Strand Satisfaction Guarantee?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="zvhc-accordion-content">
          We want you to love your ritual. Try any Zavelyn Hair Care product for a full 30 days. If you don't feel improved scalp comfort and softer, more resilient strands, simply reach out to our Dallas, TX customer care team at support@tryzavelyn.com for a hassle-free refund.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC T01 FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
